  _assemblies:
  - Drood 2.0.dll
  _author: Dooiereier
  _description: "Drood 2.0 features:\n\n\u2022 Parachutes on AG1 (steerable ram-air,
    swoop or round canopy), skydiving with steering (keys or mouse). Various landing
    animations and two types of challenges\n\u2022 Multiple tethers\n\u2022 Attach
    points on the limbs, head and torso (parts follow the limbs) and make drood invisible\n\u2022
    Look-up camera in translation mode (T), useful for fpv maneuvering in a space
    station\n\nThe stock drood is unchanged. <color=red>Requires Juno Harmony.</color>\n\nJump
    plane: ExcaliburAerospace's Cessna Caravan (SimpleRockets.com), with permission."
  _loadPriority: 1000
  _name: Drood 2.0
